#21500
The UnderDark~
This area was adapted from a merc area. It's a useful section of tunnels
for connecting further underground areas too.
Vex.
ps. The original zone was written by Yaegar.
pss. Theres an existing connection point south of room 21587.
~
215 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#21501
The Underdark~
Some how, it seems even darker here then in the tunnels to the south, your
now far from the surface, and you feel another wave of panic overcome you, as 
your mind rebels against this utterly alien environment. Even the black
cavern was not as bad as this- here there is no light, no sound, just utter
darkness, only slightly lessened by your light source. It is said that the
Underdark itself has a far greater impact on adventurers than its many
dangerous denizens.

A passage slopes down from here.
~
215 13 0 0 0 0 255 0
D2
A cleverly concealed door is more visible from this side.
~
