#21502
A Cavern~
You suddenly emerge into a large cavern, and are relieved to see more light
as your light source reflects off hundreds of tiny crystals imbedded in the
walls and ceiling of this cave. Hundreds of stalactites and stalagmites
obscure your vision, but you are fairly sure you can see exits to the east
and south. You hear what sounds like construction going on to the east.
~
