#21504
A Cavern~
You have entered yet another of the innumerable caverns that exist in the
underdark. This one has no crystals to enhance your light, however, and
you slowly creep around the circumference to locate any exits. You find
passages to the east and west, and steeply sloping passages to the north and
south, the northern one sloping upward, the souther downward.
~
